{
  "uid": "mereka-lms-auth",
  "title": "Mereka LMS - Auth",
  "description": "Cluster-Loki view of nonprod LMS and Authentik auth failure signals.",
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "tags": [
    "mereka-lms",
    "auth",
    "applications",
    "logs",
    "loki",
    "nonprod"
  ],
  "links": [
    {
      "icon": "doc",
      "targetBlank": true,
      "title": "LMS Auth Dashboard Contract",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "https://github.com/Biji-Biji-Initiative/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/waves/WAVE-2026-04-11-L7-LMS-AUTH-CANONICALIZATION.md"
    },
    {
      "icon": "doc",
      "targetBlank": true,
      "title": "Source Auth Filters",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "https://github.com/Biji-Biji-Initiative/mereka-lms/blob/main/infrastructure/monitoring/dashboards/auth.json"
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Scope and Signal Model",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "# Mereka LMS auth\n\nThis board translates the old GCM auth dashboard into canonical Grafana using **cluster Loki**.\n\n| Stream | Current selector |\n|---|---|\n| LMS auth failures | `{namespace=~\"mereka-lms-dev|stg-mereka-lms\", container=\"lms\"}` |\n| LMS CSRF / OIDC config failures | `{namespace=~\"mereka-lms-dev|stg-mereka-lms\", container=\"lms\"}` |\n| Authentik authorize 4xx | `{namespace=\"authentik\", container=\"server\"}` |\n\nThis board is intentionally sparse. It is for real auth failure spikes and drilldown, not routine JWT middleware noise."
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Dev Auth Failures (24h)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 5
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({namespace=\"mereka-lms-dev\", container=\"lms\"} |~ \"(?i)(login_session|authentication|login_failed)\" |~ \"(HTTP/1\\.1 401|HTTP/1\\.1 403|HTTP/1\\.1 500|\\\"status\\\":4[0-9]{2}|\\\"status_code\\\":4[0-9]{2}|\\\"status\\\":500|\\\"status_code\\\":500)\" [24h]))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
